	(text_box "--- USART Half-duplex (QMK) ---\nhttps://github.com/qmk/qmk_firmware/blob/master/docs/serial_driver.md\n  - Faster than bitbang driver (default)but requires a pin supporting TX\n  - Internal pull-up drive the line high (no need to add external pull-up)\n  - Using PIO driver any pin can be used as TX or RX pins"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 26.67 0)
		(size 87.63 15.24)
